@startuml getReleaseNumberAsync
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getReleaseNumberAsync – Retrieve HTTP Server Release List
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "HTTP Server Interface" as hsi #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
             wants to retrieve all release entries
end note

requestor -> hsi: (none)
activate hsi

hsi -> jd: read logical-termination-point
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> hsi: HTTP server LTP List with capability
deactivate jd

note over hsi
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Access http-server-interface capability for each LTP  
  - Extract release-list array  
  - Preserve release-number, release-date, and changes for each entry  
  - Prepare response array  
  - Return empty array if no release-list exists
end note

hsi --> requestor: releaseHistoryArray
deactivate hsi

@enduml
